WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,080 --> 00:00:04,980
Excuse me

2
00:00:07,570 --> 00:00:09,410
I never thought there would be such conservative girls nowadays

3
00:00:09,410 --> 00:00:10,770
In fact, I am also very conservative

4
00:00:10,770 --> 00:00:11,850
Who asked you?

5
00:00:11,850 --> 00:00:14,260
I have never been in love in my whole life

6
00:00:14,260 --> 00:00:15,660
Am I more conservative than her?

7
00:00:15,660 --> 00:00:17,060
OK OK OK

8
00:00:17,060 --> 00:00:18,260
You are the most conservative

9
00:00:18,260 --> 00:00:21,790
Have you traded gold coins yet?

10
00:00:21,790 --> 00:00:23,790
The price of gold coins is very high now

11
00:00:23,790 --> 00:00:26,590
I asked several people who were willing to trade gold coins

12
00:00:26,590 --> 00:00:28,590
They all just want weapons and blueprints

13
00:00:28,590 --> 00:00:41,760
If the mall doesn’t produce food and water today,

14
00:00:41,760 --> 00:00:43,760
At most half of the supplies can be exchanged

15
00:00:43,760 --> 00:00:47,070
There's no point in looking forward to something that hasn't happened.
